sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/Manager"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.leave.show)"
    participant Controller as "LeaveRequestController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi alasan lalu klik Tolak
    View->>Controller: POST /leaves/{id}/reject + rejection_reason
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi rejection_reason wajib
    Controller->>Model: Ambil data pengajuan by id
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_request by id
    DB-->>Model: Data pengajuan

    alt Data valid (reason terisi & status pending)
        Controller->>Model: reject(id, approved_by, reason)
        Model->>DB: UPDATE leave_requests\nSET status='rejected', rejection_reason=?, approved_by=?, approved_at=NOW()
        DB-->>Model: Update success
        Model-->>Controller: Pengajuan ditolak
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + success
        View-->>Admin: Status berubah menjadi Ditolak
    else Data tidak valid (reason kosong/bukan pending/error)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error/validation
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal menolak cuti
    end
